<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fernz summary of earnings forecasts.</title>
<headline>Fernz summary of earnings forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemicals group Fernz Corp Ltd on released the following detailed earnings forecasts at Thursday's annual meeting (in NZ$ millions, years to May 31).</p>
<p>			   1996	 1997	 1998	  1999</p>
<p>			   Actual     Forecast   Forecast    Forecast</p>
<p>Fertiliser	     22.9	 19.5	 21.8	  21.2</p>
<p>Agchem/animal health 18.8	 18.8	 23.1	  28.3</p>
<p>Chemicals		 6.8	 10.9	 12.6	  15.5</p>
<p>Subtotal		 48.5	 49.2	 57.5	  65.0</p>
<p>Interferon project   (5.0)	(1.9)	 1.2	   5.3</p>
<p>Corporate		43.5	 47.3	 58.7	  70.3</p>
<p>- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
